<div class="page-header"><h1>Become a Kitchen Cabinet Dealer in Nevada</h1><p>Pinnacle Sales is the manufacturer's representative for Shiloh, Eclipse, Aspect, Pronorm German Kitchens, and Vistora Closets across Nevada — recruiting and supporting kitchen & bath dealers from the Las Vegas Valley up to Reno and the Tahoe basin, backed by 23+ years of in-market experience.</p></div>
