<h2 id="why-partner-with-pinnacle">Why Partner With Pinnacle Sales in Nevada</h2>
<p>If you run a kitchen & bath showroom or design studio in Nevada, Pinnacle Sales gives you a portfolio that spans every market tier — from semi-custom value built for the Las Vegas Valley's new-construction volume to handleless German luxury for Summerlin, The Ridges, and MacDonald Highlands. You get protected territory, in-person line training, design and quoting support, and showroom merchandising backed by 23+ years of dealer relationships.</p>

<h2 id="lines-you-can-carry">Premium Lines You Can Carry in Nevada</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/shiloh-cabinetry/">Shiloh Cabinetry</a></strong> — American-made custom paint and wood species; the versatile choice for Nevada's transitional and contemporary kitchens, with strong dealer margins.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry/">Eclipse Cabinetry</a></strong> — Frameless, full-access construction for the sleek Las Vegas contemporary look.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/aspect-cabinetry/">Aspect Cabinetry</a></strong> — Value semi-custom built for the Valley's high new-construction and builder volume.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens/">Pronorm German Kitchens</a></strong> — Handleless, precision-engineered fronts for high-end Summerlin, The Ridges, and MacDonald Highlands homes, with protected dealer territory.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/vistora-closets/">Vistora Closets</a></strong> — Made-to-order closets and storage to grow whole-home revenue.</li>
</ul>

<h2 id="nevada-market-opportunity">The Nevada Market Opportunity</h2>
<p>Nevada's kitchen market is led by the Las Vegas Valley — Summerlin, Henderson, and the master-planned luxury communities — with a growing Reno–Tahoe market drawing transplants and second-home buyers. Las Vegas kitchens skew contemporary and high-contrast: flat-slab and frameless fronts, dramatic stone, integrated lighting, and a glamorous, finished feel suited to the Valley's modern architecture. High-end communities like Summerlin, The Ridges, and MacDonald Highlands push toward handleless <a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens/">Pronorm</a> and seamless <a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry/">frameless</a> kitchens, while the Reno–Tahoe market blends contemporary with mountain-modern warmth — a high-margin opportunity for dealers carrying the lines that fit the region's design.</p>

